# Build context of apps/web/Dockerfile (repository root). Keep secrets, local state and other
# stacks out of the context; the image needs package*.json, .npmrc, packages/ and apps/{web,site}.
.git
.github
**/.DS_Store
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/node_modules
**/.svelte-kit
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/.turbo
**/.vite
apps/web/build
apps/site/dist
apps/site/.astro
apps/mobile
services
infra
docs
scripts
*.md
